    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 30 minutes of debate on H.R. 2925.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2024-05-08",
   "actionTime": "13:21:34",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 6192, H.R. 7109, H.J. Res. 109 and H.R. 2925. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 6192 under a structured rule and H.R. 7109, H.J. Res. 109, and H.R. 2925 under a closed rule. Rule provides for one hour of general debate on H.R. 6192, H.R. 7109, and H.J. Res. 109, and thirty minutes of general debate on H.R. 2925. One motion to recommit allowed on each bill.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
